  "bodyHash": "q/3bIhdIigs=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/360/javaw_iec6ixifbi.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">殭屍、屍殼和沉屍在生成時，身上可能會有物品插出來，讓它們更具特色。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此外，這些物品在它們死亡時有較低機率掉落，掉落機率取決於物品清單的來源。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">共有4個階級（清單）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-普通（箭矢）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-罕見（木製、金製、石製工具和追跡之箭）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-稀有（鐵製工具和剪刀）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-史詩（鑽石工具）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這些可以在物品標籤資料夾中找到並修改。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">掉落機率可以透過設定檔調整，設定檔位於設定資料夾中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">您也可以調整選擇最多3個物品時，從哪個物品清單中選擇的機率。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">目前模組支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.1.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.1.x | 1.21.x</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.1.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">相容於 <strong>Fresh Animations</strong></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1402/911/638909354589974674.png\" width=\"256\"></strong></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果您需要不同版本的模組，或是在 CurseForge 上遇到任何錯誤，請發送私訊給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（推特）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p>",
